# FFmpeg sidecar binary manifest — tech-stack §5
# Checksums are verified by CI at packaging time.
# Binaries are NOT committed to git (see .gitignore).
#
# Format: SHA256  filename  platform/ABI
#
# TODO (T4.1): populate with pinned FFmpeg release SHA256s.
# Example:
# abc123...  ffmpeg-windows-x64.exe       windows/x64
# def456...  ffmpeg-linux-x64             linux/x64
# 789abc...  ffmpeg-android-arm64         android/arm64-v8a
# 012def...  ffmpeg-android-armv7         android/armeabi-v7a
# 345678...  ffmpeg-android-x86_64        android/x86_64
